# Route: guide 37 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 59 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thousand Needles, Searing Gorge, Loch Modan, The Hinterlands,
# Hillsbrad Foothills, Western Plaguelands, Durotar, Winterspring): Freewind
# Post -> Darkcloud Pinnacle -> Freewind Post -> Windbreak Canyon -> Splithoof
# Crag -> The Shimmering Flats -> Grimesilt Dig Site -> Stonesplinter Valley
# -> Stonewrought Dam -> Hiri'watha -> Shadra'Alor -> Tarren Mill ->
# Hiri'watha -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arikara (5088; Arikara 28);
# Encrusted Tail Fins (1107; Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37,
# Saltscale Tide Lord 37, Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36);
# Necklace Recovery (2283; Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian
# 36-37, Shadowforge Digger 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault
# Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter 36-37); The Crown of Will (519; Targ
# 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39); The Crown of Will (520; Mug'thol 43).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Gahz'rilla (2770), Blackhand's Command (7761), The Left
# Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8966), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's
# Amulet (8967), The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8968), The Left
# Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8969), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's
# Amulet (8989), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8990), The Right
# Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet (8991), The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's
# Amulet (8992), Mea Culpa, Lord Valthalak (8995), Jammal'an the Prophet
# (1446), The Grave Knight (96986), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher
# (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466),
# Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569).

